# Lorehold Charm, third mode: "Creatures you control get +1/+1 and gain trample until end of turn." Bot1's first Ornithopter
# becomes a 1/3 with trample; Bot2's Ornithopter is not Bot1's and stays 0/2 without trample; a second Ornithopter Bot1 casts after
# the charm resolved is not affected (CR 611.2c). At the next turn the first one is a 0/2 without trample again (CR 514.2).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Ornithopter
Lorehold Charm
Ornithopter
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x20

